 "conventions": {
  "root": "Every ship part and anchor descends from the root; move, rotate or scale the root only.",
  "anchors": "Local +X is the effect axis (exhaust: aft for the main drives, down for the lift thrusters; line of fire); +Z as near hull-dorsal as that allows (toward the bow for a downward axis).",
  "turrets": "Rotate Turret <i> pivot about its local Z to train within its arc about the slot angle; the rest pose is the slot angle. Twelve turrets; the four flare launchers are fixed.",
  "engines": "Engines 1-6 are the main drives, 7-12 the lift thrusters (lift thruster 1-6); with the effects collection each has its own throttle, thr_throttle_e<i>.",
  "grapples": "Animate grapples on COLOSSUS MK.III control (0 stowed, 1 clamped). To carry the Tarsus, parent her root at grapples.tarsus_origin_units, scaled tarsus_scale_in_these_units.",
  "launch_bay": "Fighters leave from launch_points along +X, out of the bay mouth in the bow.",
  "metric": "Hull units; multiply by metres_per_unit for metres. Nothing in the asset is in metres."
 },
